abstract: "Modular Python pipeline for geospatial data integration on the H3 hexagonal grid — downloads sources with caching and retry logic, standardizes them to H3 cells (default resolution 9), merges multiple datasets, and serves togglable layers in a Dash/Plotly dashboard. GeoPandas, uv, with a test suite."
